&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD) pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with scripting languages (e.g. Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with embedded C development on microcontroller cores (ARM, AVR, MSP430, PIC, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with automation of test equipment such as oscilloscopes, power supply and JTAG&lt;/li&gt;
