&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sobre o Grupo QuintoAndar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Somos o Grupo QuintoAndar, o maior ecossistema imobiliário da América Latina. Guiados por um propósito compartilhado de ajudar pessoas a amar o lugar onde moram, contamos com um portfólio diversificado de marcas e soluções, em diferentes países da América Latina, que contemplam todas as fases da jornada do morar e ainda um Hub de Tecnologia em Portugal. Desenvolvemos tecnologias e inovação para transformar e impulsionar a experiência de moradia como um todo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Com o apoio de uma equipe de classe mundial de investidores e consultores, como Kaszek, Qualcomm, General Atlantic e SoftBank, o Grupo QuintoAndar está atualmente avaliado em mais de US$ 5,1 bilhões e continua a crescer ano após ano.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aqui você trabalhará com os melhores profissionais do mercado, em um ambiente que respira inovação, colaboração e alto desempenho. Para saber mais sobre a nossa história, acesse &lt;a href=&quot;https://grupoquintoandar.com/pt/&quot;&gt;https://grupoquintoandar.com/pt/&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Por que essa vaga é afirmativa para pessoas com deficiência?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O Grupo QuintoAndar está comprometido com a promoção da Inclusão Social e um dos pilares é a representatividade em nossos times. Acreditamos que através da geração de mais oportunidades e de ações intencionais, avançaremos na construção e fortalecimento da inclusão social em nosso ambiente.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vale ressaltar que para essa vaga o nosso processo seletivo não sofreu alterações de etapas ou formas de avaliação. Entendemos que o recrutamento é uma porta de entrada para a diversidade, sempre atentos ao que nos torna plurais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localização &amp;amp; Modelo de Trabalho&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;O time de &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Inside Sales (Inbound)&lt;/strong&gt; atua em formato &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;49&quot;&gt;híbrido&lt;/strong&gt;, unindo a liberdade do home office à integração presencial em nosso escritório, localizado na &lt;strong&gt;Vila Leopoldina&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;151&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(São Paulo/SP)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Presencialidade:&lt;/strong&gt; 1x por semana, obrigatoriamente às &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;52&quot;&gt;terças-feiras&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Jornada:&lt;/strong&gt; De segunda a sexta-feira.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Etapas do Processo Seletivo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As etapas dos nossos processos seletivos têm como objetivo avaliar suas experiências e oferecer a você a oportunidade de conhecer nossos times e oportunidades de carreira, sendo estruturadas da seguinte forma:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triagem;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DG (Dinâmica de Grupo);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrevista com Hiring Manager;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrevista com Stakeholder;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer o/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sobre a Área&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trabalhar no time de Inside Sales do QuintoAndar é atuar no coração da nossa conversão de novos negócios. Somos um time dinâmico, movido por energia alta e foco em resultados imediatos. Lidamos com uma demanda receptiva de proprietários de imóveis, onde o objetivo é transformar o contato inicial em uma parceria de sucesso através de uma venda de impacto e consultiva.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiência em Inside Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Vivência consolidada em vendas internas, preferencialmente em operações de alta cadência e volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perfil Negociador:&lt;/strong&gt; Foco em fechamento rápido (&lt;em&gt;One Call Close&lt;/em&gt;) e habilidade consultiva para contornar objeções de forma imediata e assertiva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resiliência e Energia:&lt;/strong&gt; Alta capacidade de manter o ritmo e o entusiasmo em ambientes dinâmicos, com foco constante em resultados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disciplina e Organização:&lt;/strong&gt; Rigor na gestão de horários e compromissos, garantindo a organização necessária para uma operação presencial de alta produtividade.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comunicação Persuasiva: Excelente fluidez verbal e escrita, com foco em técnicas de negociação para lidar diretamente com proprietários.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diferenciais&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiência em Inside Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Vivência prévia em operações de &lt;strong&gt;Inbound Sales&lt;/strong&gt; (vendas receptivas).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domínio Tecnológico:&lt;/strong&gt; Experiência com ferramentas de atendimento massivo ou sistemas de &lt;strong&gt;CRM&lt;/strong&gt; de alta performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversidade e Experiência (50+): &lt;/strong&gt;Valorizamos a diversidade em todas as suas formas. Encorajamos fortemente a candidatura de profissionais 50+ que possuam maturidade, resiliência e queiram aplicar sua bagagem comercial em um ambiente dinâmico&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atendimento Consultivo e Conversão:&lt;/strong&gt; Realizar atendimento receptivo multicanal (WhatsApp e Telefone) com foco em alta performance e conversão de vendas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proatividade no Fluxo:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduzir contatos ativos durante o atendimento para acelerar resoluções e otimizar a experiência e o tempo do proprietário.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multitasking e Gestão de Ferramentas:&lt;/strong&gt; Gerenciar simultaneamente ferramentas de CRM e plataformas de atendimento, garantindo agilidade e precisão nos registros.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foco em Metas e Resiliência: &lt;/strong&gt;Atuar com foco no atingimento de metas desafiadoras, mantendo a organização e o equilíbrio emocional em cenários de alta demanda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Importante&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;O nosso processo seletivo começa na candidatura! Se você está realmente a fim de fazer parte do nosso time, foque nessa etapa do processo. Nós analisamos todos os candidatos individualmente e damos retorno para todas as pessoas que investiram tempo em se candidatar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Toda comunicação é feita por e-mail, então fique atento às nossas mensagens e libere o domínio @quintoandar.com.br para nossos e-mails não irem parar no spam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefícios&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salário competitivo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PLR - Participação nos Lucros e Resultados&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remuneração variável (Somente para vagas comerciais)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vale Refeição e Alimentação&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plano de saúde (mensalidade custeada, sem coparticipação para colaboradores PcDs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plano odontológico&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seguro de vida&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auxílio creche e Auxílio parentalidade atípica&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellhub&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auxílio home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QuintoCare: Nosso programa de apoio (saúde mental, assistência social, apoio jurídico e financeiro)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Licença parental estendida&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dia livre de aniversário, Dia das Mães e Dia dos Pais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clube de Benefícios (descontos em serviços do dia a dia)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Descontos em instituições de ensino&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kit leiturinha para crianças - Playkids&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversidade &amp;amp; Inclusão no Grupo QuintoAndar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Valorizamos a diversidade e queremos que todas as pessoas se sintam bem-vindas por aqui — independentemente da sua idade, identidade de gênero, orientação sexual, raça, cor, etnia, origem, deficiência, religião ou qualquer outra característica. Todas as nossas vagas são abertas para todas as pessoas! Você verificará que existem algumas perguntas sobre diversidade no formulário de inscrição. Em vagas afirmativas, as informações poderão ser utilizadas para verificar o seu alinhamento com o público-alvo da oportunidade, podendo, nesses casos, ter caráter eliminatório. Para vagas não afirmativas, esses dados serão utilizados de forma anonimizada, exclusivamente para acompanhar e aprimorar nossas práticas de inclusão nos processos seletivos e sem impacto na sua candidatura.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacidade e Proteção a Dados&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O Grupo QuintoAndar atua em conformidade com as leis de privacidade e proteção de dados, incluindo, mas não se limitando à Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados Pessoais - LGPD (Lei nº 13.709/2018), e garante a segurança de seus dados pessoais. Para saber mais, acesse o nosso&lt;a href=&quot;https://carreiras.quintoandar.com.br/aviso-de-privacidade-para-pessoas-candidatas/&quot;&gt; Aviso de Privacidade para Pessoas Candidatas&lt;/a&gt;. Se tiver dúvidas ou quiser exercer seus direitos como titular de dados, entre em contato com a gente pelo&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cognitoforms.com/QuintoAndarcom/LeiGeralDeProte%C3%A7%C3%A3oDeDadosPessoaisLGPD&quot;&gt; Canal de Atendimento&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

qumracapital-appsflyer:greenhouse:852850.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;At AppsFlyer, we believe every challenge is an invitation to innovate. We’re looking for a Strategic Account Manager to help us shape the future of measurement. In this role, you’ll work with talented professionals across the globe within a culture that values curiosity, collaboration, and personal development. If you&#39;re ready to bring your skills to a global stage, this is your chance to make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;You will own the entire commercial lifecycle for AppsFlyer’s enterprise clients. As a strategic partner, you’ll guide customers through sales, expansions, renewals, and beyond, building long-term, impactful relationships that drive both client success and AppsFlyer’s growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Execution and Territory Growth: Own and grow a portfolio of enterprise clients through new sales, expansions, cross-sells, and renewals. Meet and exceed revenue targets consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen and Expand Customer Relationships: Build trust with clients by understanding their business objectives and providing value through thought leadership, insights, and tailored solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executional Excellence: Ensure impeccable customer service, proactively address challenges, and implement strategies to maximize retention and minimize churn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally: Partner with internal teams like product, customer success, and marketing to deliver solutions that meet client needs and drive revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of SaaS experience, ideally in analytics, mobile, or the MarTech space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Russian is required; proficiency in additional languages is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage complex deal cycles and contract negotiations with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in account mapping and planning at Enterprise level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of consistently meeting revenue quotas and delivering value-based recommendations to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical understanding and ability to explain complex solutions to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment, with a proactive approach to identifying growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AppsFlyer, we’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace. Don’t meet 100% of the qualifications? If you’re excited about this role and believe you have the skills to succeed, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Mobile Measurement Partner (MMP) platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduced by an AppsFlyer team member.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AppsFlyer is a global company with 20 offices worldwide. Through mental health programs like &lt;em&gt;Be Well&lt;/em&gt;, the Global Employee Exchange Program, and fitness programs, we empower our people to thrive physically, mentally, and professionally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here, titles don’t define us—ideas do. You’ll thrive in a culture where everyone’s input shapes the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

qumracapital-appsflyer:greenhouse:858511.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a rock star in India who&#39;s a people person and has a knack for getting things done. In the past couple of years, our &lt;strong&gt;Bangalore&lt;/strong&gt; office has experienced rapid growth and needs someone efficient to get the team to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain office facilities in good condition, including general needs for the Bangalore office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hospitalize and ensure all visitors and guests receive excellent customer service and are welcomed accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for general office management and duties including phone calls and email screening, drafting letters, and maintaining overall office conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise office assistant and maids to ensure the best service is provided on a daily basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage company assets and maintain them in good condition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop close relationships with the landlord, building management team, and vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor inventory of office supplies and swags, and manage purchasing of new materials with attention to budgetary constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and organize events including sourcing, negotiating and booking suitable venues, dinner and lunch reservations, and management of invitations and attendance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and organize company team meetings and activities for both in-office and off-site events such as the annual team outing, sports and wellness activities, team bonding activities, catering arrangements, and quarterly CSR activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize and monitor costs and expenses for both Operations and People Experience budgets; ensure the most effective utilization under quarterly and annually allocated budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foresee and forecast upcoming activities and quarterly budget requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for new hire onboarding logistics — including workstation setup, access provisioning coordination, and day-one experience — in partnership with the People team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support health, safety, and compliance requirements for the office, including maintaining emergency contacts, conducting periodic safety checks, and liaising with building management on regulatory matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a cultural anchor for the Bangalore office — proactively identifying morale-boosting moments, local team celebrations, and inclusion touchpoints that reflect the company&#39;s global values locally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a real-time office operations tracker (headcount capacity, asset register, vendor contracts, renewal dates) to enable proactive rather than reactive management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of office management and administrative experience, high-tech company experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and detail-oriented with multi-tasking abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed and ready to take initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must handle confidential information with discretion and professionalism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding interpersonal and communication skills for negotiation and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with remote offices around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a 50–100 person office through a period of growth or transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage vendor relationships and negotiate cost-effective contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively with global and regional teams and stakeholders on cross-functional projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with tools such as Google Workspace, Slack, or equivalent collaboration platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warm, approachable presence — the kind of person people feel comfortable going to, whether it&#39;s a maintenance issue or a sensitive request; the face and heartbeat of the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence — able to read the room, manage up, manage across, and de-escalate situations calmly without making things bigger than they need to be&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership mindset — doesn&#39;t wait to be told; spots a problem and solves it; takes pride in the office running smoothly as a reflection of personal standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient under pressure — stays composed and solution-focused when multiple things demand attention at once, whether it&#39;s a VIP visit, a vendor no-show, or a last-minute event change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplomatically assertive — able to push back on unreasonable requests, hold vendors accountable, and set boundaries professionally without burning relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretion as a default — handles sensitive people, financial, and operational information with maturity and zero drama&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a global company operating in 19 countries across 5 continents, we reflect the human mosaic of the diverse and multicultural world in which we live. We ensure equal opportunities for all of our employees and promote the recruitment of diverse talents to our global teams without consideration of race, gender, culture, or sexual orientation. We value and encourage curiosity, diversity, and innovation from all our employees, customers, and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appsflyer.com/blog/how-all-in-shaped-our-story-and-could-define-your-career/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;“As a Customer Obsessed company, we must first be Employee Obsessed. We need to make sure that we provide the team with the tools and resources they need to go All-In.”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Oren Kaniel, CEO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

remotely-bridgebio:greenhouse:5108523007.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Assoc. Director, Field Medical Excellence &amp;amp; Operations &lt;/strong&gt;is a remote/field-based scientific expert responsible for communicating with a variety of internal and external stakeholders, providing medical and scientific information on the appropriate utilization of therapy(s), and advancing therapeutic disease state knowledge. The Assoc. Director/Director, Field Medical Excellence &amp;amp; Operations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;is a core member of the Medical Affairs Team, leveraging a scientific approach aligned with medical affairs objectives and therapeutic area medical plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Assoc. Director, Field Medical Excellence &amp;amp; Operations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;will be experienced, working in a fast-paced, highly collaborative environment, specifically with product launch planning, rare disorders, or underdiagnosed patient populations.&amp;nbsp; This includes developing and executing a comprehensive field medical strategy plan, planning coverage and attending conferences, conducting trainings for field medical team and other cross-functional counterparts, delivering scientific presentations, and scientific exchange with physicians and other healthcare providers.&amp;nbsp; This role will be critical to compliantly evolving field medical initiatives, analytical reporting (insights and field activity), content development, conference coverage, and training for new hires across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position reports to the National Head, Field Medical Affairs, and will require extensive travel, sometimes involving weekends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assigned responsibilities for the Assoc. Director, Field Medical Excellence &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Head of Medical Affairs to define field medical strategy, HCP engagement plans, and coverage approach to meet company-defined goals within corporate and regulatory guidelines for products both marketed and in development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assist with development and implement frameworks for field effectiveness, including KPIs, activity metrics, and qualitative impact measures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support field medical launch readiness (territory design, targeting, resource planning)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support and drive coordination of a robust conference plan, coverage, and reporting with an expectation to attend and providing active coverage/reporting for global/national/regional conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
