&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;98&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;147&quot;&gt;Senior Visual/UI Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to craft user-centric and visually engaging digital experiences. You will play a key role in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;265&quot;&gt;designing interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; for web and mobile applications, ensuring usability, accessibility, and brand consistency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;360&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;365&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;393&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;393&quot; data-end=&quot;516&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;395&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;User Interface Design&lt;/strong&gt; – Develop intuitive and aesthetically appealing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;469&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; for websites and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;517&quot; data-end=&quot;628&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;519&quot; data-end=&quot;546&quot;&gt;Graphic &amp;amp; Visual Design&lt;/strong&gt; – Create icons, illustrations, and other UI assets, ensuring brand consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;748&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;663&quot;&gt;Responsive &amp;amp; Adaptive Design&lt;/strong&gt; – Design layouts that work seamlessly across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;709&quot; data-end=&quot;745&quot;&gt;various screen sizes and devices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;749&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;751&quot; data-end=&quot;780&quot;&gt;Wireframing &amp;amp; Prototyping&lt;/strong&gt; – Build &lt;strong data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;low-fidelity wireframes&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;interactive prototypes&lt;/strong&gt; to test design concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;993&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;UX Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; – Work closely with UX researchers to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;understand user needs and improve user experiences&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;994&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;996&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;Style Guides &amp;amp; Design Systems&lt;/strong&gt; – Maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;design systems&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure consistency across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;Usability &amp;amp; Accessibility&lt;/strong&gt; – Conduct &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1144&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;usability testing&lt;/strong&gt; and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot;&gt;accessible design principles&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Iterative Design&lt;/strong&gt; – Continuously refine and evolve designs based on user feedback and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;1319&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1324&quot; data-end=&quot;1351&quot;&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;2076&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1356&quot; data-end=&quot;1368&quot;&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1388&quot; data-end=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;Visual/UI/Web Designer&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;Degree or Diploma in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;Design, HCI, or a related field&lt;/strong&gt;, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1516&quot; data-end=&quot;1610&quot;&gt;A &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1520&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;strong portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; showcasing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;1574&quot;&gt;visually appealing&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1579&quot; data-end=&quot;1607&quot;&gt;user-friendly UI designs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1611&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1675&quot;&gt;Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Sketch, Figma&lt;/strong&gt;, or other industry-standard tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1713&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1796&quot;&gt;layout, typography, color theory, and visual hierarchy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1903&quot;&gt;Experience working in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1824&quot; data-end=&quot;1850&quot;&gt;cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborating with developers and UX researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1904&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot;&gt;web and mobile technologies&lt;/strong&gt; and their impact on design feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1993&quot; data-end=&quot;2076&quot;&gt;Ability to stay updated on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2022&quot; data-end=&quot;2073&quot;&gt;design trends, tools, and emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2078&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2102&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2102&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2120&quot; data-end=&quot;2145&quot;&gt;front-end development&lt;/strong&gt; (HTML, CSS, SCSS, JavaScript, Responsive Web Design).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2226&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2208&quot; data-end=&quot;2224&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2458&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2314&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2237&quot; data-end=&quot;2261&quot;&gt;high-impact projects&lt;/strong&gt; shaping user experiences across digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2315&quot; data-end=&quot;2387&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2334&quot; data-end=&quot;2384&quot;&gt;talented designers, developers, and UX experts&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2388&quot; data-end=&quot;2458&quot;&gt;Be part of a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2403&quot; data-end=&quot;2455&quot;&gt;fast-paced, creative, and innovative environment&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2460&quot; data-end=&quot;2506&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2460&quot; data-end=&quot;2504&quot;&gt;Ready to bring ideas to life? Apply now!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
