&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Xealth, we&#39;re revolutionizing healthcare by leveraging data and automation to empower care providers (building on EHRs such as Epic and Cerner) to seamlessly prescribe, deliver, and monitor digital health for patients. We are a detail-oriented team, committed to maintaining the highest standards while moving with agility and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a highly skilled, collaborative, and passionate group, applying our expertise to improve health outcomes for millions. We believe in shared ownership and are looking for a team player who is a self-starter and self-driven to pioneer the next generation of intelligent, automated cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers a unique opportunity to build out a self-optimizing cloud platform in a mission-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own and Deliver (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a core member of our software engineering team, you will design, build, and scale the services and applications that power Xealth’s EHR integrations and clinical workflows. You’ll apply solid computer science fundamentals to solve complex problems in distributed systems, data modeling, and API design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and Develop Core Services:&lt;/strong&gt; Build robust, maintainable backend services in TypeScript/Node.js and other modern technologies that power our EHR integrations and clinical workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Systems and Cloud Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with DevOps engineers to deploy and operate microservices in AWS using containerization and orchestration tools (e.g., Kubernetes, ECS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to code reviews, system design discussions, and technical decisions that raise the engineering bar across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation and AI in Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI-assisted coding tools like GitHub Copilot to streamline development, increase quality, and accelerate delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Patient Engagement Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Design, build, and scale key services handling patient notifications, click tracking, and other critical user engagement workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provider and Patient facing applications:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the development and enhancement of our provider- and patient-facing applications, building intuitive and scalable user interfaces with React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrate Patient Education Vendors:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain reliable, scalable integrations with third-party patient education content providers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Expertise You&#39;ll Bring (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a software engineer with strong computer science fundamentals — someone who’s comfortable reasoning about systems, data, and code structure at scale, and who’s excited to apply those skills in healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Technical Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 3-5 years of professional experience building production software systems using TypeScript/JavaScript.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CS Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of algorithms, data structures, object-oriented design, concurrency, and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API and Integration Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience designing and building RESTful or event-driven APIs with Node.js/Nest/Express.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting and Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in diagnosing complex issues across distributed services using logs, traces, and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration and Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working in an agile startup environment, balancing quality with rapid iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Front-End Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build, test, and deploy modern, scalable web applications using React and TypeScript, with expertise in the unique engineering and performance challenges of both mobile and desktop web platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly Valued Experience (Nice to Have)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a healthcare startup or health data integration platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with high-throughput messaging platforms or services built for mass-scale user communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS or another cloud vendor, e.g. GCP, Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building applications with Tailwind.css&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Xealth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Xealth created the leading digital health platform helping health systems deliver connected, personalized care at scale. Embedded in the EHR, it enables clinicians to prescribe, automate, and measure the impact of digital tools--including apps, services, and wearable data--within existing workflows. Now part of Samsung&#39;s connected care vision, Xealth enhances decision-making, reduces friction, and supports enterprise-wide digital health strategies. Trusted by more than 500 hospitals and 70+ solution partners, Xealth provides a scalable foundation for delivering connected, personalized, and preventative care--empowering health systems to drive outcomes, engagement, and operational efficiency while advancing digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a market-leading digital health platform recognized for excellence and culture, some of our recent accolades include: Newsweek’s World’s Best Digital Health Companies (2024-2026), consecutive Gold Digital Health Awards, and we were named a BuiltIn Best Place to Work for 2025 and 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Xealth offers a multi-tiered approach when constructing a highly competitive compensation package. The compensation package would include a base salary, bonus, and a comprehensive suite of benefits. The base salary compensation range for this position is $145,000 - $200,000, depending on geographic market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f37c.png&quot; alt=&quot;:baby_bottle:&quot; aria-label=&quot;baby bottle emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:baby_bottle:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Paid parental leave.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f49d.png&quot; alt=&quot;:gift_heart:&quot; aria-label=&quot;gift heart emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:gift_heart:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision policies. Xealth covers 100% of employee premiums. We also provide Employee Assistance Programs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f4bb.png&quot; alt=&quot;:computer:&quot; aria-label=&quot;computer emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:computer:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Xealth provides your laptop and offers a home office stipend.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f4da.png&quot; alt=&quot;:books:&quot; aria-label=&quot;books emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:books:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Generous learning &amp;amp; development opportunities for you to grow your skills and career.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f3e6.png&quot; alt=&quot;:bank:&quot; aria-label=&quot;bank emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:bank:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;401k Match: Xealth offers a dollar-for-dollar match up to 3%.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f3dd-fe0f.png&quot; alt=&quot;:desert_island:&quot; aria-label=&quot;desert island emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:desert_island:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flexible time off &amp;amp; 10 standardized holidays.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f6b2.png&quot; alt=&quot;:bike:&quot; aria-label=&quot;bike emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:bike:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;$500 yearly fitness stipend to spend on staying active.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Xealth is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Please note - you MUST be a U.S. Citizen or Permanent Resident to be hired*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Xealth is open to hiring in the following states - Arizona, California, Idaho, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Missouri, New Jersey, North Carolina, Ohio, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Texas, Utah, Washington, Wisconsin.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

threshold-xealth:greenhouse:7772299003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Xealth, we’re revolutionizing healthcare by leveraging data and automation to empower care providers—building on EHRs such as Epic and Cerner—to seamlessly prescribe, deliver, and monitor digital health for patients. We are a detail-oriented team committed to maintaining high standards while moving with agility and impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As Marketing Manager at Xealth, you will be the in-house lead for demand-side marketing execution. Where the Director of Communications owns Xealth’s narrative, thought leadership, media and analyst relations, and customer storytelling, you own the demand engine — directing the agency’s campaign work, running our industry events, activating sales enablement in the field, executing partner and co-marketing programs, and keeping marketing operations and pipeline reporting running cleanly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own and Deliver (Responsibilities)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Partnership &amp;amp; Campaign Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as day-to-day owner of Xealth’s relationship with the agency for the demand-generation scope — briefs, reviews, approvals, scope, timeline, and performance against the monthly retainer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Xealth priorities into clear campaign briefs and review outputs — sales decks, sell sheets, battle cards, explainer videos, ROI calculator, landing pages, nurture emails, paid social creative, ABM materials — for accuracy, sales usability, and adherence to existing brand and messaging guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line up product, sales, and customer success experts to feed demand-side work, and route demand-side marketing assets through the right Xealth approvers (product, legal, executive) on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track agency hours, deliverables, and out-of-pocket expenses against the retainer; flag overages and reallocate scope as priorities shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-House&lt;/strong&gt; Demand Generation &amp;amp; Funnel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and run in-house nurture streams that complement the campaign-driven nurtures — multi-step email sequences for prospects in evaluation, stalled sales cycles, and dormant accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own post-event outreach — conference follow-ups, customer dinner thank-yous, webinar attendee nurtures, and meeting recap sequences — mapped to lead status in CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write ad copy and newsletter content for Xealth’s in-house channels — subject lines, body copy, and CTAs — working within the messaging set by the Director of Communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute select tactical paid social campaigns (event promotion, recruiting, time-sensitive announcements) alongside in collaboration with the Communications Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Website &amp;amp; External Brand Consistency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day content and updates for Xealth’s website beyond editorial pieces — product pages, solutions, About, Resources, Partners, Careers, navigation copy, and forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain template libraries (decks, one-pagers, social graphics, email templates) so internal teams can produce on-brand materials quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Industry Events, Webinars &amp;amp; Media Buys&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute Xealth’s physical event presence (HIMSS, ViVE, HLTH, ATA, and customer/partner forums) end-to-end — sponsorships, booth, signage, swag, staffing, lead capture, and follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize and project-manage webinars — Xealth-owned and Sage-led sponsored webinars (e.g., Becker’s) — including invitation lists, registration, attendee outreach, run-of-show, and rehearsal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage publisher and sponsorship relationships (Becker’s, MedCity, and other inbound publisher pitches) — evaluate opportunities, negotiate buys, contract, and project-manage delivery alongside the agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run executive briefings, customer dinners, partner roundtables, and field events that move active opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the lead-capture-to-CRM workflow and report on event-sourced and event-influenced pipeline; coordinate with the Director of Communications on earned-media moments tied to events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement Activation &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive in-field adoption of sales tools (pitch deck, sell sheets, battle cards, explainer video, economic value calculator) — distribution, sales training, rollout, and a feedback loop back to Sage for refinement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the day-to-day operational artifacts with the agency — talk tracks, email templates, follow-up sequences, and CRM cadences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the Xealth product team, assist in the creation of assets to use to promote adoption of new or existing Xealth product features or capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with sales leadership on the marketing-to-sales handoff, MQL → SQL SLAs, and conversion reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor Community Promotion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With the VP Partnerships, maintain Xealth’s marketing vendor directory — printers, swag and merch, event production, video, design, paid media platforms, and list providers — including scope, pricing, performance, and renewal tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over time, coordinate with additional resources in the partner team to promote vendor-targeted initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Operations, Vendors &amp;amp; Pipeline Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day operation of the marketing technology stack — CRM (Hubspot), marketing automation, lead routing, list hygiene, and database compliance (GDPR/CAN-SPAM), working with sales to link to sales CRM processes (Salesforce).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take&amp;nbsp; monthly performance dashboards and translate them for Xealth leadership and sales — pipeline contribution, MQL/SQL volumes, cost per opportunity, and campaign ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clean attribution and source data flow from campaigns into Xealth’s CRM, and coordinate with the Director of Communications so marketing pipeline reporting and communications KPIs tell one consistent story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why Join Xealth?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; This role offers the autonomy to build intelligent, self-driving infrastructure — the future of cloud operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meaningful Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Your engineering directly enables better patient care and health outcomes for millions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cutting-Edge Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with modern tools and a team that prioritizes technical excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best Workplace: &lt;/strong&gt;Xealth has been named to the World&#39;s Best Digital Health Companies list by Newsweek, awarded gold in the Digital Health awards in 2024 and twice in 2023. In 2026 Xealth was also listed as one of BuiltIn&#39;s Best Places to Work, and one of Fierce Healthcare&#39;s Fierce 15 of 2023.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Xealth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Xealth created the leading digital health platform helping health systems deliver connected, personalized care at scale. Embedded in the EHR, it enables clinicians to prescribe, automate, and measure the impact of digital tools--including apps, services, and wearable data--within existing workflows. Now part of Samsung&#39;s connected care vision, Xealth enhances decision-making, reduces friction, and supports enterprise-wide digital health strategies. Trusted by more than 500 hospitals and 70+ solution partners, Xealth provides a scalable foundation for delivering connected, personalized, and preventative care--empowering health systems to drive outcomes, engagement, and operational efficiency while advancing digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a market-leading digital health platform recognized for excellence and culture, some of our recent accolades include: Newsweek’s World’s Best Digital Health Companies (2024-2026), consecutive Gold Digital Health Awards, and we were named a BuiltIn Best Place to Work for 2025 and 2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Xealth offers a multi-tiered approach when constructing a highly competitive compensation package. The compensation package would include a base salary, bonus, and a comprehensive suite of benefits. The base salary compensation range for this position is $115,000 - $125,000 depending on geographic market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f37c.png&quot; alt=&quot;:baby_bottle:&quot; aria-label=&quot;baby bottle emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:baby_bottle:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Paid parental leave.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f49d.png&quot; alt=&quot;:gift_heart:&quot; aria-label=&quot;gift heart emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:gift_heart:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision policies. Xealth covers 100% of employee premiums. We also provide Employee Assistance Programs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f4bb.png&quot; alt=&quot;:computer:&quot; aria-label=&quot;computer emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:computer:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Xealth provides your laptop and offers a home office stipend.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f4da.png&quot; alt=&quot;:books:&quot; aria-label=&quot;books emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:books:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Generous learning &amp;amp; development opportunities for you to grow your skills and career.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f3e6.png&quot; alt=&quot;:bank:&quot; aria-label=&quot;bank emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:bank:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;401k Match: Xealth offers a dollar-for-dollar match up to 3%.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f3dd-fe0f.png&quot; alt=&quot;:desert_island:&quot; aria-label=&quot;desert island emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:desert_island:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flexible time off &amp;amp; 10 standardized holidays.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;c-emoji c-emoji__medium c-emoji--inline&quot; data-qa=&quot;emoji&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://a.slack-edge.com/production-standard-emoji-assets/14.0/apple-medium/1f6b2.png&quot; alt=&quot;:bike:&quot; aria-label=&quot;bike emoji&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;emoji&quot; data-stringify-emoji=&quot;:bike:&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;$500 yearly fitness stipend to spend on staying active.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Xealth is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Please note - you MUST be a U.S. Citizen or Permanent Resident to be hired*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Xealth is open to hiring in the following states - Arizona, California, Idaho, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Missouri, New Jersey, North Carolina, Ohio, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Texas, Utah, Washington, Wisconsin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

